        "comments": "The assembly mRhiHip2.hap2.2 is based on 39x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds are named by synteny based on Rhinolophus hipposideros (lesser horseshoe bat) GCA_964194185.1. Chrosmome X was identified through synteny analysis with Rhinolophus ferrumequinum (GCA_004115265.3)The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 27 (8,873 - 10,165 Kbp) are unknown.",
